      " type="button" id="carousel-next-btn-recipe-related-teasers"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  CarouselTeasers_carousel-teasers__btn-icon__zaZ_q" style="display:inline-block;height:20px;width:20px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/chevron-right/regular.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/chevron-right/regular.svg)"></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="RecipePage_recipe-page__hero--desktop__aakQM"></div><div id="instructions" class="undefined RecipePage_recipe-page__scroll-traget__7upt_"><div class="RecipeProcess_process__g_Epj"><div class="RecipeProcess_process__header__7JRmG"><h2 class="display--M">Slik gjør du</h2></div><div class="RecipeProcess_process__wake-lock__B7itz"></div><ol class="RecipeSteps_recipe-steps__list__BlhdR"><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1337824"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">1.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Skrell potetene og kok dem i en kjele med vann til de er møre (bruker du nypoteter er det ikke nødvendig å skrelle dem). Hell av kokevannet og avkjøl potetene helt. Del dem i passe store biter.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1337825"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">2.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Finkutt vårløk og løk og ha det i en bolle sammen med sylteagurk og potetbiter.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1337826"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">3.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span><p>Bland  majones, rømme, sylteagurklake, soyasaus og tabasco. Smak til med litt salt og pepper.</p></span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1337827"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">4.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Vend potetene inn i dressingen. Sett potetsalaten kjølig et par timer før servering. Juster om nødvendig smaken med litt mer salt, pepper og sylteagurklake.</span></span></span></label></li></ol><div class="RecipeProcess_process__text__PaMsd RecipeProcess_process__after__xYqvg"><div class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><div><div data-possibleclass=""></div><div class="TextBlock_text-block-item__HFoE_"><div class="InfoboxBlock_infobox__LZ4Vo InfoboxBlock_infobox--lightGreen__qr_ec"><div class="InfoboxBlock_infobox__icon__IkI5S"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:32px;width:32px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/info/regular.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/info/regular.svg)"></span></div><div class="InfoboxBlock_infobox__text__oILaD"><div class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><div><p>Bruk denne oppskriften som en grunnoppskrift, og varier den med for eksempel biter av syrlig eple, kapers, stilkselleri eller grønne oliven for å lage din helt egne spesialsalat. Finhakkede urter smaker alltid godt i potetsalat - for eksempel dill, gressløk, persille eller timian.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div></div>
<div data-possibleclass=""><img loading="lazy" src="https://images.matprat.no/lxfkjenqpu-tinymce__w=920/potetsalat_høyde.jpg" alt="Potetsalat" class="tinymce-vertical" /></div></div></div></div><div class="RecipeProcess_process__rating-wrapper__F9Wkp"><div class="UserRating_user-rating__container___npfH"><div><ul class="StarButtons_star-buttons__list__UNhKw"><li class="undefined"><button type="button" class="StarButtons_star-buttons__button__zaEW_"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:30px;width:30px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg)"></span><span class="visuallyhidden">1 stjerner</span></button></li><li class="undefined"><button type="button" class="StarButtons_star-buttons__button__zaEW_"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:30px;width:30px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg)"></span><span class="visuallyhidden">2 stjerner</span></button></li><li class="undefined"><button type="button" class="StarButtons_star-buttons__button__zaEW_"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:30px;width:30px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg)"></span><span class="visuallyhidden">3 stjerner</span></button></li><li class="undefined"><button type="button" class="StarButtons_star-buttons__button__zaEW_"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:30px;width:30px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/star-empty/light.svg)